  "description": "An MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew from Coast Guard Air Station Astoria rescues two local fire and rescue personnel near Cape Kiwanda, Ore. who were searching the area on personal watercraft for a 17-year-old girl when they fell into the water as sea conditions began to worsen Feb. 1, 2016.\r\n\r\nOne responder was dropped off at the beach and the other was transferred to emergency medical services personnel in Lincoln City.\r\n\r\nU.S. Coast Guard video courtesy of Coast Guard Air Station Astoria.",
